  "migration_impact": [
    "H5 requires result_commit_id to be 7 to 64 lowercase hex digits. The existing shared fixture in workstreams/po03/tests/test_validate_contracts.py uses 'abc123', which is six characters and would need to become a real abbreviated object id.",
    "H7 requires the manifest to appear as an artifact named manifest.json carrying manifest_sha256. Existing committed documents that manifest only result.json would need one additional artifact entry.",
    "H9 requires idempotency_key to contain both commission_id and task_id as colon-delimited segments. Keys abbreviated to 'COM-PO03:...' would need the full commission id.",
    "H12 relaxes artifacts[].bytes to a minimum of zero. The JSON Schema would need the same relaxation to stay aligned.",
    "H11 widens the transaction states permitted under PROVIDER_COMPLETED_UNCOMMITTED, which is a relaxation and cannot invalidate an existing accepted document.",
    "H1 rejects undeclared properties, which the JSON Schema already forbids. Any existing document carrying extra keys was already schema-invalid."
  ],
